                                   \u003Cp>Fragment 1 shows a consistent left margin to the text; vacats at the end of some lines on fragment 3 show an irregular right margin to the text.\u003C/p>\n                                    \u003Cdamage ana=\"#text_condition.complete\"/>\n                                \u003C/layout>\n                            \u003C/layoutDesc>\n                        \u003C/objectDesc>\n                        \u003ChandDesc>\n                            \u003ChandNote>\u003Cp> open omega, sigma with diverging top and bottom strokes.\u003C/p>\n                                \u003Clocus from=\"line1\" to=\"line1\">Line 1\u003C/locus>\n                                \u003Cdimensions type=\"letterHeight\">\n                                    \u003Cheight unit=\"mm\"/>\n                                \u003C/dimensions>\n                            \u003C/handNote>\n                        \u003C/handDesc>\n                    \u003C/physDesc>\n                    \u003Chistory>\n                        \u003Corigin>\n                            \u003CorigPlace>\u003Cregion>Sicilia\u003C/region>\n                                \u003CplaceName type=\"ancient\" ref=\"https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/462334\"/>\n                                \u003CplaceName type=\"modern\" ref=\"https://www.geonames.org/6537815/\">Monte Casasia\u003C/placeName>\n                                \u003Cgeo>37.102892, 14.718176\u003C/geo>\n                            \u003C/origPlace>\n                            \u003CorigDate datingMethod=\"#julian\" evidence=\"archaeological-context material-context lettering\" notBefore-custom=\"-0600\" notAfter-custom=\"-0551\">first half of the 6th century BCE\u003C/origDate>\n                        \u003C/origin>\n                        \u003Cprovenance type=\"found\">Found in the so-called 'Casa della grotta', a mediaeval hermitage, on Monte Casasia\u003Cgeo>37.102892, 14.718176\u003C/geo>.\u003C/provenance>\u00